### Configuración de Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/users
@authUrl = http://localhost:3000/auth
@adminSecretKey = Adnsu8@we

### 1. Crear un usuario común
# @name createUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Este Perez",
  "email": "Este.perez@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

@createdUserId = {{createUser.response.body.id}}

### 2. Login con el usuario creado
# @name loginUser
POST {{authUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "Este.perez@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

@userToken = {{loginUser.response.body.token}}

### 3. Obtener el usuario creado, con su propio token(mal armado-expirado,daría 401/403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{createdUserId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

###

### 4. Crear un Administrador
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Admin Universidad",
  "email": "admin@utn.edu",
  "password": "adminSecurePassword",
  "secretKey": "{{adminSecretKey}}"
}

###

### 5. Intentar crear Administrador con clave incorrecta (debe dar 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Intruso",
  "email": "hacker@example.com",
  "password": "hack",
  "secretKey": "clave_incorrecta_2026"
}

###

### 6. Login como admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{authUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@utn.edu",
  "password": "adminSecurePassword"
}

###

@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### 7. Obtener todos los usuarios (con token de admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 8. Actualizar datos del usuario creado
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{createdUserId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

{
  "name": "Juan Carlos Perez"
}

###

### 9. Eliminar al usuario creado
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{createdUserId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

###

### 10. Buscar al usuario eliminado (debe dar 404, con token de admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{createdUserId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}